OL,3,GNEWSACost of mayor's Indian trade      
OL,4,Amission trip revealed                  
OL,6,FThe cost to North Yorkshire taxpayers  
OL,7,Fof a mayoral trade mission to India was
OL,8,Fmore than #85,000, recently released   
OL,9,Ffigures show.                          
OL,11,FDavid Skaith and eight staff from the  
OL,12,FYork and North Yorkshire Combined      
OL,13,FAuthority (YNYCA) were accompanied by  
OL,14,F12 external delegates on the trip to   
OL,15,FHyderabad and Mumbai last month.       
OL,17,FThe combined authority spent a total of
OL,18,F#85,102 on flights, stays at five-star 
OL,19,Fhotels, and meals on the trip, a       
OL,20,FFreedom of Information (FOI) request   
OL,21,Fhas revealed.                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
